<title>USA: Advanced Marketing CFO to resign.</title>
<headline>Advanced Marketing CFO to resign.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Marketing Services Inc said Wednesday its Chief Financial Officer Jon Fish will resign on June 30 to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>Fish joined the company as chief financial officer in 1990. The company said in a statement it is seeking a suitable replacement.</p>
